{"entryType": "UniProtKB reviewed (Swiss-Prot)", "primaryAccession": "Q9NY25", "secondaryAccessions": ["Q52M11", "Q9UKQ0"], "uniProtkbId": "CLC5A_HUMAN", "entryAudit": {"firstPublicDate": "2005-02-15", "lastAnnotationUpdateDate": "2026-06-10", "lastSequenceUpdateDate": "2000-10-01", "entryVersion": 176, "sequenceVersion": 1}, "annotationScore": 5.0, "organism": {"scientificName": "Homo sapiens", "commonName": "Human", "taxonId": 9606, "lineage": ["Eukaryota", "Metazoa", "Chordata", "Craniata", "Vertebrata", "Euteleostomi", "Mammalia", "Eutheria", "Euarchontoglires", "Primates", "Haplorrhini", "Catarrhini", "Hominidae", "Homo"]}, "proteinExistence": "1: Evidence at protein level", "proteinDescription": {"recommendedName": {"fullName": {"value": "C-type lectin domain family 5 member A"}}, "alternativeNames": [{"fullName": {"value": "C-type lectin superfamily member 5"}}, {"fullName": {"value": "Myeloid DAP12-associating lectin 1"}, "shortNames": [{"value": "MDL-1"}]}]}, "genes": [{"geneName": {"value": "CLEC5A"}, "synonyms": [{"value": "CLECSF5"}, {"value": "MDL1"}]}], "comments": [{"texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250", "source": "UniProtKB", "id": "Q9R007"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "10449773"}], "value": "Functions as a positive regulator of osteoclastogenesis (By similarity). Cell surface receptor that signals via TYROBP (PubMed:10449773). Regulates inflammatory responses (By similarity)"}], "commentType": "FUNCTION"}, {"texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "18496526"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "21566123"}], "value": "(Microbial infection) Critical macrophage receptor for dengue virus serotypes 1-4 (PubMed:18496526, PubMed:21566123). The binding of dengue virus to CLEC5A triggers signaling through the phosphorylation of TYROBP (PubMed:18496526). This interaction does not result in viral entry, but stimulates pro-inflammatory cytokine release (PubMed:18496526)"}], "commentType": "FUNCTION"}, {"texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250", "source": "UniProtKB", "id": "Q9R007"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "10449773"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "21566123"}], "value": "Monomer (PubMed:21566123). Homodimer (PubMed:21566123). The majority of CLEC5A is expressed as a monomeric form on macrophages (PubMed:21566123). Interacts with TYROBP/DAP12 (PubMed:10449773). The interaction with TYROBP is required for CLEC5A cell surface expression (PubMed:10449773). Interacts with HCST/DAP10 (By similarity). Forms a CLEC5A/TYROBP/HCST trimolecular complex depending almost solely on TYROBP (By similarity)"}], "commentType": "SUBUNIT"}, {"texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "18496526"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "21566123"}], "value": "(Microbial infection) Interacts with dengue virus envelope protein E (PubMed:18496526, PubMed:21566123)"}], "commentType": "SUBUNIT"}, {"commentType": "SUBCELLULAR LOCATION", "subcellularLocations": [{"location": {"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "21566123"}], "value": "Cell membrane", "id": "SL-0039"}, "topology": {"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "21566123"}], "value": "Single-pass type II membrane protein", "id": "SL-9906"}}]}, {"commentType": "ALTERNATIVE PRODUCTS", "events": ["Alternative splicing"], "isoforms": [{"name": {"value": "1"}, "isoformIds": ["Q9NY25-1"], "isoformSequenceStatus": "Displayed"}, {"name": {"value": "2"}, "isoformIds": ["Q9NY25-2"], "sequenceIds": ["VSP_012839"], "isoformSequenceStatus": "Described"}]}, {"texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "10449773"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "20212065"}], "value": "Highly expressed in bone marrow with lower levels in synovium, lung and bronchus (PubMed:20212065). Expressed in peripheral blood monocytes and in the monocyte/macrophage cell lines U-937 and Mono-Mac-6, but not in cell lines of other origins (PubMed:10449773). Expression is down-regulated when monocytes differentiate into dendritic cells (PubMed:10449773)"}], "commentType": "TISSUE SPECIFICITY"}, {"texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250", "source": "UniProtKB", "id": "Q9R007"}], "value": "N-glycosylated. Contains sialic acid residues"}], "commentType": "PTM"}, {"texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250", "source": "UniProtKB", "id": "Q9R007"}], "value": "Acts as a key regulator of synovial injury and bone erosion during autoimmune joint inflammation when its activation leads to enhanced recruitment of inflammatory macrophages and neutrophils to the joints"}], "commentType": "MISCELLANEOUS"}, {"commentType": "WEB RESOURCE", "resourceName": "Functional Glycomics Gateway - Glycan Binding", "resourceUrl": "http://www.functionalglycomics.org/glycomics/GBPServlet?&operationType=view&cbpId=cbp_hum_Ctlect_244", "ftp": false, "note": "MDL-1"}], "features": [{"type": "Chain", "location": {"start": {"value": 1, "modifier": "EXACT"}, "end": {"value": 188, "modifier": "EXACT"}}, "description": "C-type lectin domain family 5 member A", "featureId": "PRO_0000046632"}, {"type": "Topological domain", "location": {"start": {"value": 1, "modifier": "EXACT"}, "end": {"value": 4, "modifier": "EXACT"}}, "description": "Cytoplasmic", "evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000255"}]}, {"type": "Transmembrane", "location": {"start": {"value": 5, "modifier": "EXACT"}, "end": {"value": 27, "modifier": "EXACT"}}, "description": "Helical; Signal-anchor for type II membrane protein", "evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000255"}]}, {"type": "Topological domain", "location": {"start": {"value": 28, "modifier": "EXACT"}, "end": {"value": 188, "modifier": "EXACT"}}, "description": "Extracellular", "evidences": [{"evidenceCode": 